<h1>PNW Moths</h1>
<figure class="home-range-map" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <img src="/images/pnw-range.svg" width="384" height="400"
       alt="Map of the Pacific Northwest region covered by this site — Washington, Oregon, Idaho, and adjacent parts of British Columbia, Montana, and northern California">
  <figcaption>This site covers the moths of the Pacific Northwest.</figcaption>
